WEBVTT

00:01:33.090 --> 00:01:34.900
<i>Long ago,</i>

00:01:34.900 --> 00:01:38.760
<i>it was said that countless beings existed with power great enough to control the world.</i>

00:01:38.760 --> 00:01:46.070
<i>They were called demon lords, devils, dark gods.</i>

00:01:46.070 --> 00:01:50.610
<i>The world was constantly in danger of being destroyed at their hands.</i>

00:01:50.610 --> 00:01:56.260
<i>But, there were warriors, now called legendary heroes...</i>

00:01:56.260 --> 00:01:59.790
<i>They would appear, with power far greater than that of the demon lords.</i>

00:01:59.790 --> 00:02:02.370
<i>And they would slay the monsters.</i>

00:02:11.180 --> 00:02:14.980
<i>Who were these so-called "heroes,"</i>

00:02:14.980 --> 00:02:17.300
<i>who defeated monsters strong enough to destroy the world?</i>

00:02:17.300 --> 00:02:22.180
<i>If relics of them were to be found, their value would be great.</i>

00:02:23.960 --> 00:02:28.830
<i>As to whether these so-called demon lords and heroes truly existed...</i>

00:02:29.340 --> 00:02:31.540
<i>The Alpha Stigma will enlighten us.</i>

00:02:34.420 --> 00:02:35.970
<i>A simple attack spell.</i>

00:02:35.970 --> 00:02:36.970
<i>Attribute: Flame.</i>

00:02:36.970 --> 00:02:38.340
<i>Attack range: 20.</i>

00:02:38.350 --> 00:02:41.790
<i>Activation method: Nelpha pattern crest form.</i>

00:02:41.790 --> 00:02:44.730
<i>Power level: A. Adjusted value: 0-7-2.</i>

00:02:45.520 --> 00:02:49.560
Flare Burst!

00:02:53.740 --> 00:02:55.170
The same magic?

00:02:55.170 --> 00:02:58.760
How can a Rolandian use Nelphan magic?

00:03:05.790 --> 00:03:07.500
The Alpha Stigma...

00:03:07.500 --> 00:03:08.150
Alpha Stigma?

00:03:08.150 --> 00:03:08.830
Monster?

00:03:08.830 --> 00:03:10.420
He's a monster!

00:03:11.610 --> 00:03:13.340
Don't use magic!

00:03:13.340 --> 00:03:15.420
He'll steal Nelphan magic!

00:03:15.420 --> 00:03:19.740
Sending an Alpha Stigma monster as a spy?

00:03:20.060 --> 00:03:24.080
Does Roland seek to start a war against Nelpha?

00:03:24.080 --> 00:03:25.240
That's not...

00:03:25.240 --> 00:03:27.270
That's not right.

00:03:27.630 --> 00:03:28.580
Ferris?

00:03:29.430 --> 00:03:33.740
Does this foppish man look like he could spy on anything?

00:03:34.420 --> 00:03:35.880
Hey...

00:03:36.910 --> 00:03:39.270
Does the truth hurt?

00:03:39.270 --> 00:03:43.410
What does that make you, if you follow that fop around?

00:03:45.210 --> 00:03:46.410
A lovely lady.

00:03:51.870 --> 00:03:53.200
Just kidding.

00:03:53.200 --> 00:03:56.590
Sh-She's adorable!

00:03:56.590 --> 00:03:59.260
Don't be fooled!

00:04:02.740 --> 00:04:04.100
All hands, attack!

00:04:04.100 --> 00:04:09.650
Wait, we're just searching for relics of the hero left here in Nelpha...

00:04:21.530 --> 00:04:23.960
R-Retreat! Retreat!

00:04:25.910 --> 00:04:30.340
Hold up! We don't want war! We just want the hero's...

00:04:32.290 --> 00:04:35.560
Ouch, that seriously hurts! What's your problem?

00:04:37.200 --> 00:04:40.920
Do you comprehend the concept of a covert operation?

00:04:40.920 --> 00:04:44.910
What would we accomplish talking about hero relics?

00:04:46.290 --> 00:04:50.550
Would you mind doing your job without unnecessary comments?

00:04:50.550 --> 00:04:52.640
T-Terribly sorry, ma'am!

00:04:55.650 --> 00:04:58.380
As long as you get it. We'll resume our mission.

00:04:58.380 --> 00:04:59.660
Let's go, Ryner.

00:04:59.660 --> 00:05:00.150
Yeah...

00:05:02.850 --> 00:05:08.790
Man... Missions, hard work, I can't stand that stuff.

00:05:08.790 --> 00:05:12.780
Don't lag behind. If you drag your feet, I'll go on without you.

00:05:12.780 --> 00:05:14.460
Yes, ma'am!

00:05:15.610 --> 00:05:16.940
Found him!

00:05:20.560 --> 00:05:21.470
Yes?

00:05:21.470 --> 00:05:23.030
We're looking for relics

00:05:23.030 --> 00:05:28.130
of heroes scattered across the world and bringing them back to Roland, right?

00:05:28.130 --> 00:05:32.450
So why are you sitting around in a tea house eating dumplings?

00:05:33.820 --> 00:05:37.740
This dumpling recipe is simply scrumptious.

00:05:38.120 --> 00:05:41.540
It could easily stand alongside Roland's Wynnit dumpling shops!

00:05:41.540 --> 00:05:43.150
I couldn't care less.

00:05:44.520 --> 00:05:47.370
How could you not care less about dumplings?

00:05:48.850 --> 00:05:53.200
Besides, you wrote the report on the hero's relics.

00:05:53.200 --> 00:05:55.250
I'm just your guard.

00:05:55.250 --> 00:05:58.870
Your situation won't change while you just sit around.

00:06:04.860 --> 00:06:06.250
Let's see.

00:06:06.250 --> 00:06:10.440
Right now, we're aroudn the Nelpha-Roland border.

00:06:10.440 --> 00:06:13.310
The relic in question should be southwest of here.

00:06:13.660 --> 00:06:15.670
Which means...

00:06:15.670 --> 00:06:20.150
With the mountains that way, plus the distance we walked so far today...

00:06:20.150 --> 00:06:22.360
But, according to the description in these ancient writings...

00:06:22.940 --> 00:06:29.840
This sucks. I'm tired, I want to take a nap. I could sleep for 80 years.

00:06:29.840 --> 00:06:33.250
You two are from Roland, aren't you?

00:06:33.250 --> 00:06:35.750
Uhm, yes.

00:06:35.750 --> 00:06:37.790
No need for alarm.

00:06:37.790 --> 00:06:43.070
There are plenty in Nelpha who hate Roland, but I don't.

00:06:43.890 --> 00:06:45.930
I appreciate that.

00:06:45.930 --> 00:06:51.320
In the old days, the kings of Roland fought wars all over the place.

00:06:51.320 --> 00:06:53.500
It was pretty bad.

00:06:53.500 --> 00:06:57.300
But the revolution two years ago crowned a new king.

00:06:57.300 --> 00:06:59.500
It's been pretty different!

00:06:59.500 --> 00:07:00.310
Yes, ma'am.

00:07:00.310 --> 00:07:05.800
The Hero King, Sion Astal. So young, yet so impressive!

00:07:05.800 --> 00:07:08.710
And super-hot, on top of that!

00:07:08.710 --> 00:07:14.000
Ever since I saw his portrait, this old lady's been a fan!

00:07:14.000 --> 00:07:16.160
Nonsense. That's incorrect.

00:07:16.160 --> 00:07:19.640
He is no hero. He is a devil.

00:07:19.640 --> 00:07:20.860
A devil?

00:07:20.860 --> 00:07:25.880
Yes. That smiling face conceals the nature of an evil devil.

00:07:26.250 --> 00:07:30.970
A heartless monster who holds dumplings as hostages to scare me!

00:07:30.970 --> 00:07:33.730
Yeah, seriously. Sure, he looks nice,

00:07:33.730 --> 00:07:36.570
but he's really a workaholic bully of a king

00:07:36.570 --> 00:07:41.110
who likes to work his best friend to the bone!

00:07:41.110 --> 00:07:44.160
For once, you're onto something, Ryner.

00:07:44.160 --> 00:07:49.990
Yeah, see? And on top of that, he dumps this crap job on me!

00:07:49.990 --> 00:07:51.420
Shall we get it done?

00:07:51.420 --> 00:07:53.530
Yes, let's.

00:08:01.580 --> 00:08:03.750
Hail to the Hero King!

00:08:03.750 --> 00:08:05.590
Hail to the Hero!

00:08:05.590 --> 00:08:08.010
The king's so handsome today!

00:08:08.010 --> 00:08:11.970
Thanks to Lord Sion, this kingdom's grown so prosperous.

00:08:11.970 --> 00:08:16.040
It'll only get better from here. Roland is changing.

00:08:16.040 --> 00:08:20.690
With Lord Astal here, Roland's future is in good hands!

00:08:29.920 --> 00:08:34.930
Welcome back, Lord Sion. How was the situation in the Celyoa region?

00:08:34.930 --> 00:08:36.400
Worse than anticipated.

00:08:36.400 --> 00:08:38.770
Last year's flood left heavy damages.

00:08:38.770 --> 00:08:41.680
The Celyoa region shall be granted a temporary tax exemption.

00:08:41.680 --> 00:08:44.370
Calne, make immediate revisions to the budget.

00:08:44.370 --> 00:08:45.350
Yes sir!

00:08:45.350 --> 00:08:47.040
Miller, what's the situation in the capital?

00:08:47.040 --> 00:08:48.680
No problems worth mentioning.

00:08:48.680 --> 00:08:53.250
Duke Sterleded and Count Klausberr made a big move...

00:08:53.250 --> 00:08:56.610
It seems their objective was to show off their political clout.

00:08:56.610 --> 00:08:58.240
The same as usual.

00:08:58.660 --> 00:09:01.140
Claugh, what's the state of our neighboring lands?

00:09:01.140 --> 00:09:05.360
Sion, come on. Straight to work the moment you return?

00:09:05.360 --> 00:09:07.000
Rest a little!

00:09:07.000 --> 00:09:10.790
I can't. This land has just begun to change.

00:09:10.790 --> 00:09:14.250
If I ease my hand now, everything will be lost.

00:09:16.780 --> 00:09:19.490
Back to the age of kings and nobles consumed by greed,

00:09:19.490 --> 00:09:22.670
who devoured the world as they pleased.

00:09:23.690 --> 00:09:28.640
But if you collapse here, it'll all come to nothing.

00:09:28.640 --> 00:09:32.490
Everyone in this kingdom has pinned their hopes on you.

00:09:32.490 --> 00:09:36.650
Yes, sometimes even Claugh can say something deep.

00:09:36.650 --> 00:09:38.380
Sometimes?

00:09:38.380 --> 00:09:43.750
Er... Please, try to rely on us a little more!

00:09:43.750 --> 00:09:46.560
I handle domestic affairs. Miller handles the military,

00:09:46.960 --> 00:09:49.240
And you've got Claugh, for what it's worth.

00:09:49.240 --> 00:09:52.010
Calne, do you have a problem with me?

00:09:52.010 --> 00:09:54.950
Not really. I certainly don't hold any grudges

00:09:54.950 --> 00:09:58.850
for having to run around fixing things

00:09:58.850 --> 00:10:02.020
after Claugh hit on a noble's daughter, moreover...

00:10:02.020 --> 00:10:07.340
Hey, I know all about your secret meetings in the castle with Lord Pearl's woman...

00:10:07.340 --> 00:10:09.700
A report from a Nelphan squadron.
<i>Not in front of Lord Sion!</i>

00:10:09.700 --> 00:10:13.300
It looks like "they" are still wandering the nation's border.

00:10:14.610 --> 00:10:17.790
What are those two doing?

00:10:24.060 --> 00:10:27.700
According to the Book of Ams... Hey!

00:10:30.970 --> 00:10:32.160
It won't open.

00:10:32.160 --> 00:10:34.190
Listen to me when I'm talking to you!

00:10:44.110 --> 00:10:46.240
This one's pretty tough.

00:10:46.580 --> 00:10:49.260
Here goes the spell formula... Release this here, and...

00:10:49.260 --> 00:10:51.600
Then a dummy activates here, and...

00:10:51.600 --> 00:10:52.330
Get back.

00:10:57.610 --> 00:11:01.110
What was that? You could've scalped me, or worse--

00:11:22.400 --> 00:11:25.530
Alright, trap released.

00:11:25.530 --> 00:11:30.950
Man, I'm drowsy. All these tedious traps, it's too much.

00:11:31.980 --> 00:11:36.540
Quiet. For a sex-crazed pervert like you, if it doesn't involve stalking women

00:11:36.540 --> 00:11:40.630
or abducting little girls, you won't put forth any effort.

00:11:40.630 --> 00:11:42.720
When did I do any of that?

00:11:42.720 --> 00:11:44.450
That's what they all say.

00:11:47.620 --> 00:11:48.710
What's wrong?

00:11:56.480 --> 00:11:57.880
Ryner!

00:12:00.060 --> 00:12:01.830
Wait, wait, wait!

00:12:03.170 --> 00:12:05.200
What the hell was that?!

00:12:05.200 --> 00:12:06.240
Incoming.

00:12:07.730 --> 00:12:09.040
Run, Ryner!

00:12:11.220 --> 00:12:12.850
What was that?!

00:12:12.850 --> 00:12:13.610
Look!

00:12:16.130 --> 00:12:18.060
I told you.

00:12:18.760 --> 00:12:21.630
After this, you are so dea-

00:12:21.630 --> 00:12:23.930
I'm sorry. The Captain...

00:12:23.930 --> 00:12:25.640
She didn't make it in time?

00:12:40.740 --> 00:12:43.240
<i>That's Count Klausberr's crest.</i>

00:12:43.240 --> 00:12:45.420
<i>Eslina, I'll save you now!</i>

00:12:51.550 --> 00:12:53.860
Klausberr, prepare yourself!

00:12:53.860 --> 00:12:55.640
The wrong person?

00:12:57.020 --> 00:12:58.890
What's the big idea, brat?!

00:13:00.300 --> 00:13:04.640
Who sent you? You're pretty third-rate for an assassin.

00:13:04.640 --> 00:13:06.080
It's over.

00:13:06.080 --> 00:13:09.340
I'm happy because you're here, brother!

00:13:10.860 --> 00:13:12.180
Kill me, please.

00:13:13.040 --> 00:13:17.360
It's over. If I can't get Eslina back, just do it...

00:13:17.360 --> 00:13:18.360
Eslina?

00:13:18.360 --> 00:13:19.930
My little sister.

00:13:19.930 --> 00:13:24.280
This morning, she was taking a walk when Klausberr kidnapped her.

00:13:24.860 --> 00:13:28.630
I'm not strong enough to fight you nobles.

00:13:28.950 --> 00:13:33.510
Without Eslina,  there's no point in living in this corrupt world-

00:13:33.510 --> 00:13:36.700
You would abandon your sister and give up on everything?

00:13:38.120 --> 00:13:41.090
Hero King, Sion Astal?

00:13:42.300 --> 00:13:45.840
Just because you were born in the wrong country, the wrong world...

00:13:45.840 --> 00:13:47.930
You'd give up just like that?

00:13:48.350 --> 00:13:50.270
This land is indeed corrupt.

00:13:50.270 --> 00:13:53.340
But even so, I have a dream.

00:13:53.340 --> 00:13:57.190
If the land is too corrupt for dreams, why not change it?

00:13:57.190 --> 00:13:58.360
Change it?

00:13:58.360 --> 00:14:02.420
For that purpose, I will not fall short from doing whatever it takes.

00:14:10.740 --> 00:14:13.000
Well? You alive?

00:14:13.000 --> 00:14:15.510
Don't tell me you're dead.

00:14:16.920 --> 00:14:18.540
Damn it, Ferris!

00:14:19.850 --> 00:14:22.070
My stomach's in knots.

00:14:22.070 --> 00:14:23.380
Who are you?

00:14:23.380 --> 00:14:24.580
Ryner!?

00:14:29.410 --> 00:14:31.550
Now that you've seen me, there's no helping it!

00:14:31.550 --> 00:14:35.240
I'm the leader of the Roland Empire Taboo-Breaker Pursuit Squadron,

00:14:35.240 --> 00:14:36.680
Lieutenant Milk Callaud.

00:14:36.680 --> 00:14:42.350
You acquired Rolandian magic and attempted to leave without permission.

00:14:42.350 --> 00:14:44.590
You have been recognized as a taboo-breaker.

00:14:44.590 --> 00:14:47.990
In order to preserve the Rolandian magic system's secrecy,

00:14:47.990 --> 00:14:50.980
you must be put under restraint and-

00:14:50.980 --> 00:14:52.620
Owwie...

00:14:54.830 --> 00:14:57.810
I'm beat. Hungry too.

00:14:57.810 --> 00:15:01.670
Yeah. Let's finish with these ruins and go out for dumplings.

00:15:01.670 --> 00:15:02.840
Hey, wait!

00:15:02.840 --> 00:15:05.890
I'm putting you under restraint!

00:15:05.890 --> 00:15:08.020
What I seek is thunder!

00:15:08.020 --> 00:15:08.960
Izuchi!

00:15:17.980 --> 00:15:19.860
I get it, Ryner!

00:15:19.860 --> 00:15:24.780
I see you're forced to obey that pretty, violent woman!

00:15:24.780 --> 00:15:30.150
Please, Ryner. Come with me! You can still get off easy!

00:15:30.150 --> 00:15:35.250
I see. This is one of your poor victims that you cast away

00:15:35.250 --> 00:15:37.820
after sinking your poisoned fangs in and toying with them.

00:15:37.820 --> 00:15:39.630
Who was toying with them?!

00:15:39.630 --> 00:15:42.570
I haven't been abandoned!

00:15:42.570 --> 00:15:45.580
Then it's a casual relationship? How mature.

00:15:45.580 --> 00:15:46.960
That's not it!

00:15:47.510 --> 00:15:49.500
You're making fun of me!

00:15:49.500 --> 00:15:52.630
If I must, I'll use my true talent to capture you!

00:15:52.630 --> 00:15:54.170
What I seek is thunder-

00:16:04.270 --> 00:16:05.710
Luke!

00:16:05.710 --> 00:16:07.000
Guys!

00:16:07.000 --> 00:16:12.330
You mustn't investigate by yourself, Captain Milk.

00:16:12.330 --> 00:16:14.100
I'm sorry.

00:16:14.100 --> 00:16:16.580
At any rate, let us flee this place.

00:16:39.350 --> 00:16:41.080
Well, Ryner?

00:16:41.080 --> 00:16:43.910
Even with the Alpha Stigma, I can't analyze its structure at all.

00:16:43.910 --> 00:16:46.720
This is undoubtedly a hero's relic.

00:16:46.720 --> 00:16:48.870
I see. Then, how do we beat it?

00:16:48.870 --> 00:16:51.900
I can't make out its structure, so how am I supposed to know?

00:16:51.900 --> 00:16:53.690
Ryner's greatness ends right here.

00:16:53.690 --> 00:16:55.160
You're really pissing me off!

00:17:03.010 --> 00:17:04.090
Ferris!

00:17:04.090 --> 00:17:04.820
What is it?

00:17:04.820 --> 00:17:07.350
Run like you mean it!

00:17:07.350 --> 00:17:08.590
Of course.

00:17:17.740 --> 00:17:19.010
Brother!

00:17:19.010 --> 00:17:19.640
Eslina!

00:17:19.640 --> 00:17:22.660
Brother! Brother!

00:17:22.660 --> 00:17:24.870
It's all right now, Eslina.

00:17:25.390 --> 00:17:27.710
They lost their parents in the last war,

00:17:27.710 --> 00:17:30.070
and they've been living by themselves ever since.

00:17:36.480 --> 00:17:41.330
But as long as the nobles hold power, this will keep happening.

00:17:41.970 --> 00:17:47.380
Some Hero King. I know they continue to corrupt this land,

00:17:47.380 --> 00:17:51.150
yet I still lack the power to overcome it.

00:17:51.150 --> 00:17:53.720
Well, well, well, if it isn't His Majesty!

00:17:53.720 --> 00:17:55.710
I hope you're enjoying yourself?

00:17:55.710 --> 00:17:57.770
Quite, Count Klausberr.

00:17:57.770 --> 00:18:01.310
Did you see the "flower" I placed in your chambers?

00:18:02.800 --> 00:18:03.730
Yes.

00:18:03.730 --> 00:18:08.650
It's a simple, wild flower, just plucked today.

00:18:08.650 --> 00:18:11.460
If it suits your tastes, please do with it as you wish.

00:18:11.460 --> 00:18:12.860
Thank you kindly.

00:18:13.560 --> 00:18:15.990
While I may be a king, I am still young.

00:18:15.990 --> 00:18:20.390
It is my sincere wish to be of service to all of you in the future.

00:18:20.390 --> 00:18:24.580
But of course! To our young king, and to Roland's future.

00:18:24.580 --> 00:18:26.640
To Roland's future.

00:18:30.600 --> 00:18:31.750
<i>Scum.</i>

00:18:33.840 --> 00:18:35.020
What should we do?

00:18:35.020 --> 00:18:36.150
Huh?

00:18:36.150 --> 00:18:38.880
Is there any way to recover that relic?

00:18:41.310 --> 00:18:42.930
Well...

00:18:43.890 --> 00:18:45.880
Nope, no way in hell.

00:18:45.880 --> 00:18:47.870
Guess not. Okay, let's go back.

00:18:47.870 --> 00:18:51.470
Yeah, we can dump the cleanup on that workaholic!

00:18:51.470 --> 00:18:54.780
Hey, have you been wearing that this entire time?

00:18:54.780 --> 00:18:56.950
Yeah, I picked it up at the ruins.

00:18:58.240 --> 00:18:59.910
Don't say that so casually!

00:18:59.910 --> 00:19:02.020
That could be another hero's reli-

00:19:32.060 --> 00:19:33.830
Are you serious?

00:19:34.780 --> 00:19:37.760
My, just what I'd expect from a hero's relic.

00:19:37.760 --> 00:19:39.630
What do we do about this?

00:19:39.630 --> 00:19:41.410
Besides, that...

00:19:42.260 --> 00:19:43.400
...mountain?

00:19:44.900 --> 00:19:47.210
I believe the past must never be repeated.

00:19:48.990 --> 00:19:52.600
You make me jealous... Yes.

00:19:58.010 --> 00:19:59.820
It survived?!

00:20:00.920 --> 00:20:06.070
Making a break for it by yourself? Quit messing around!

00:20:09.000 --> 00:20:12.930
<i>People hate dying. They hate killing too.</i>

00:20:12.930 --> 00:20:16.220
<i>They don't like making others cry, or crying themselves.</i>

00:20:16.220 --> 00:20:19.910
<i>How must it feel not to be able to choose one's life?</i>

00:20:19.910 --> 00:20:23.620
<i>What about when a noble dies? Or when a loved one dies?</i>

00:20:24.630 --> 00:20:27.120
<i>Nobody wants those things.</i>

00:20:27.590 --> 00:20:32.750
<i>Yet, the world laughs and hungers for such suffering.</i>

00:20:33.470 --> 00:20:36.250
<i>I've never had any burning desire to change anything.</i>

00:20:37.000 --> 00:20:39.780
<i>But it would be sad without change.</i>

00:20:39.780 --> 00:20:42.860
<i>I don't want to lose anything else...</i>

00:20:42.860 --> 00:20:47.430
<i>It sucks, but I think it's about time we moved forward.</i>

00:20:47.430 --> 00:20:49.830
Were you looking at it again?

00:20:50.340 --> 00:20:51.570
Lucile.

00:20:51.810 --> 00:20:53.780
The Alpha Stigma.

00:20:53.780 --> 00:20:59.410
A pleasant dream that a lone monster clings to as it weeps.

00:20:59.410 --> 00:21:00.990
It's a fairy tale.

00:21:05.710 --> 00:21:08.210
I'll do it, Ryner.

00:21:09.330 --> 00:21:12.930
I'll become king of this land and change everything.

00:21:13.720 --> 00:21:16.430
I'll make the world you once desired.

00:21:18.230 --> 00:21:19.190
So...

00:21:21.080 --> 00:21:23.750
Ryner. Join me.

00:21:48.440 --> 00:21:49.820
Senseless.

00:23:21.550 --> 00:23:26.790
<i>Man, group-living as a student really sucks.</i>

00:23:26.790 --> 00:23:30.830
<i>There's an over-motivated person, a really nosy person...</i>

00:23:30.830 --> 00:23:33.900
<i>I just want to get some sleep.</i>

00:23:33.900 --> 00:23:35.930
<i>Man, this sucks.</i>
